		{
			dependencies: ["01CBB9F0DF924B2E"]
			description: [
				"The land trembles under the reign of a malevolent Apothic boss, a fallen titan whose strength knows no bounds. Legends speak of this fearsome creature, known for its ruthless dominance and possession of a coveted Affix item. As a valiant warrior, it falls upon your shoulders to confront this formidable foe and bring an end to its tyrannical rule. "
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"准备好迎接无情的战斗，磨练你的技巧，收集强大的装备，并招募同伴英雄。进入黑暗的核心，穿越危险的迷宫，与堕落泰坦展开史诗般的对决。唯有击败巨兽并夺取其Affix物品，你才能恢复和平，守护王国免受即将到来的厄运。"
			]
			id: "0B46831B32843DA5"
			rewards: [
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "2080833A281E2CC4"
					table_id: 6818843643653601848L
					type: "loot"
				}
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
